f\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dirty%20Turban\"><img alt=\"Dirty Turban\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dirty_Turban_7d49d3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Rope Belt\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rope_Belt_855efc.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Nomads Entrance1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"125\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Nomads_Entrance1_d08a89.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.10<br/>December 11, 2007<br/>Christmas Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places and Loot <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe Nomad cave is a quite large cave located below the mountain pass between <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>. To enter it, you must start Arito's Task. The cave is a good hunting place for low level players.\n</p><p>In a room, you can find a spawn of some <a href=\"#/wiki/Coconut\">coconuts</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Banana\">bananas</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Grapes\">grapes</a> and 2 Small Oil Lamps. All over the cave you can also stumble over different pillows, and Water Pipes.\n</p><p>Once you have performed Arito's task you can dig for the secret entrance, similar to the way you would look for a tomb. You may pass through the back door to enter the cave, without sacrificing a scimitar. (this is after going back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Muhad\">muhad</a>).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h2>\n<p>There are two entrances, the first official entrance is in the mountains between ank and dara, just east of the passage to <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33205,32544,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33205, 32544, 7)</a>.<br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"overflow-x: auto;overflow-y: auto;\"><br/>To access this entrance you need to start Arito's Task. After that you'll need to place a <a href=\"#/wiki/Scimitar\">scimitar</a> on that crack, and use a vial of water 2sqm east from the crack, and a secret entrance will appear.</div>\n<p>The second \"secret\" entrance is near the first entrance, on the desert. You'll need a shovel to open the hidden hole. Inside there is a door that can only be opened if you have completed Arito's task. So completing it is necessary to use this entrance. The hole can be found around <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33214,32553,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33214, 32553, 7)</a><br/> <b>NOTE:</b> To open the hole <b>you might have to dig multiple times</b> on the correct sand tile. <br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Nomads Entrance2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Nomads_Entrance2_cfe1d0.png\" width=\"250\"/></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Nomad Cave NPCs (1 NPC)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Muhad\">Muhad</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Muhad\"><img alt=\"Muhad\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Muhad_89345c.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Tribe Leader</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Nomad Cave</strong></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\"><img alt=\"Rotworm\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rotworm_efbfce.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworm</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">40</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">65</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">40 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-17× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Ham</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Dirt\">Lump of Dirt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a></li>\n<li>Mace (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sword\">Sword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>0-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Worm\">Worm</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\"><img alt=\"Scorpion\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scorpion_20081f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">Scorpion</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">45</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">45</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">67</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion%20Tail\">Scorpion Tail</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Nomad%20%28Basic%29\"><img alt=\"Nomad (Basic)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Nomad_Basic_61ec56.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Nomad%20%28Basic%29\">Nomad (Basic)</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">60</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">160</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">80 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-40× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>Rope Belt</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Axe\">Axe</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Armor\">Brass Armor</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dirty%20Turban\">Dirty Turban</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Mace (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>0-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Potato\">Potato</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Helmet\">Iron Helmet</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Shield\">Steel Shield</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nomad%20Parchment\">Nomad Parchment</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrion%20Worm\"><img alt=\"Carrion Worm\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carrion_Worm_3d8101.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrion%20Worm\">Carrion Worm</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">70</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">145</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">45 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-45× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrion%20Worm%20Fang\">Carrion Worm Fang</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Worm\">Worm</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coal\">Coal</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Maps\">Maps</span></h2>\n<p>The following maps show the floors of this cave, marking some <i>special</i> places.<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Nomad Cave 0\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Nomad_Cave_0_870746.png\" width=\"128\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Nomad Cave 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"248\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Nomad_Cave_1_20c184.png\" width=\"335\"/></span><br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Nomad Cave 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"208\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Nomad_Cave_2_e20250.png\" width=\"358\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Nomad Cave 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"229\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Nomad_Cave_3_3a480e.png\" width=\"267\"/></span><br/>\n</p></div>","quests":["aritos-task-quest","nomads-land-quest"]}